{%- comment -%}
  Booking page template.

  Assign this to the existing /pages/booking page in Shopify admin (Online
  Store → Pages → Booking → Theme template). The handle is fixed by Decision
  #9 and must not be recreated — the URL carries existing SEO.

  A .liquid template with a static {% section %} tag rather than
  templates/page.booking.json, for the same reason as the homepage and the
  collection page: a JSON template lets the customizer reorder, duplicate, and
  delete sections, and this page's structure is fixed by the design. Every
  setting inside the section is still editable. See PLAN.md, Decision #12.

  The section deliberately does not render the page's body content from admin —
  all of the page's copy lives in the section's own settings, so the layout
  cannot be broken by pasted markup.
{%- endcomment -%}

